view_rankings_button = tk.Button(root, text="View Rankings", command=view_rankings)

add_participant_button.pack(pady=10)
define_event_button.pack(pady=10)
record_scores_button.pack(pady=10)
view_rankings_button.pack(pady=10)

root.mainloop()
```

